    {
      "id": "6cb8122f-6a2e-4b99-94fa-6d000a1f5332",
      "name": "Generate AI Intent & Reply",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.openAi",
      "position": [
        1920,
        1360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o",
          "cachedResultUrl": "",
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        },
        "responses": {
          "values": [
            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are the customer assistant for [YOUR_BUSINESS_NAME] on WhatsApp and Instagram. [YOUR_BUSINESS_NAME] has locations in [LOCATION_1] and [LOCATION_2]. Open [OPERATING_HOURS]. Contact: [PHONE_NUMBER], [SUPPORT_EMAIL].\n\nTONE: Friendly, concise, helpful - like a knowledgeable staff member. Keep replies short (2-4 sentences). Never sound robotic or overly formal.\n\nBOOKING: When a customer wants to book, guide them step by step: \"You can book directly at [WEBSITE_URL] - just click 'Book Now', pick your location, choose a time slot, and confirm.\" If they ask which location, ask them which one they prefer before giving the link.\n\nMEMBERSHIP ([MEMBERSHIP_PROGRAM_NAME]): Explain it's free - sign up at [WEBSITE_URL] via 'Become a Member'. [DESCRIBE YOUR POINTS/REWARDS SYSTEM HERE, e.g. \"Sign up = 10 points. Every booking = 10 points. 10 points = Rs 100 off.\"]. Guide them to sign up on the website if they ask how to become a member.\n\nDISCOUNTS: Mention proactively when relevant (especially when discussing price or booking):\n- [DISCOUNT 1, e.g. \"Card payment onsite = up to 15% off\"]\n- [DISCOUNT 2, e.g. \"Student card = 10% off\"]\n- Registered companies get group discounts (they need to register; direct corporate inquiries to lead capture)\n- Promo codes are shared on [YOUR_BUSINESS_NAME]'s Instagram/social media - suggest they follow the page\n\nPRICING: Never state a fixed price confidently. Say something like: \"Pricing depends on the slot, date and time - it's shown live when you select on [WEBSITE_URL]. As an example, it's currently around [EXAMPLE_PRICE], but please confirm the exact price for your slot on the site.\"\n\nCORPORATE/GROUP/EVENT LEADS: If the message mentions group booking, corporate, event, tournament, company outing, birthday party, or similar, classify as corporate_lead. Ask politely for any missing details among: name, contact number, company/group name, expected group size, preferred date, purpose. Reply should reassure them our team will follow up soon.\n\nHUMAN HANDOFF: If the question is outside everything above (e.g. complaints, refunds, payment issues, anything you're unsure about, or the customer explicitly asks for a human), classify as human_handoff. Your reply_text in this case must ONLY be a short reassurance like: \"I've noted your query - our team will get back to you shortly to sort this out.\" Do not attempt to answer the actual question, do not guess, do not apologize excessively.\n\nAlways reply in English text, regardless of what language the customer used (English, Urdu, Roman Urdu, or voice in any of these). If the customer sends a voice message that couldn't be understood, politely ask them to type their message instead.\n\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON in this exact shape, nothing else:\n{\"intent\": \"booking_guide|membership_discount|general_faq|corporate_lead|human_handoff\", \"reply_text\": \"...\", \"lead_name\": \"\", \"lead_contact\": \"\", \"lead_group_size\": \"\", \"lead_date\": \"\", \"lead_purpose\": \"\"}"
            },
            {
              "content": "={{ $('Normalize Message').item.json.messageText }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "credential-id",
          "name": "OpenAI account 4"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "068a4804-ada7-4254-a1fc-625b987fc13b",
      "name": "Check Handoff Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        1328,
        1440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Check if this existing contact is currently in a human-handoff window.\n// Contacts sheet must have columns: status (active/handed_off) and handoff_time (ISO timestamp).\nconst row = $json;\nconst HOURS_LIMIT = 4;\nlet skipReply = false;\n\nif (row.status === 'handed_off' && row.handoff_time) {\n  const handoffTime = new Date(row.handoff_time);\n  const hoursSince = (Date.now() - handoffTime.getTime()) / (1000 * 60 * 60);\n  if (hoursSince < HOURS_LIMIT) {\n    skipReply = true;\n  }\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { ...row, skipReply } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
